  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GOVERNOR&apos;S OFFICE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme aims to promote agriculture for development in Niassa, based on sustainable food system, and increase access to basic social services (Education, health, water and sanitation), good governance and PFM. It is focused on food, as it will contribute to improvements in sustainable systems, which strengthen agriculture and markets for inclusive economic growth, affordable, good nutrition and improved well-being. This will strengthen governance for effective institutions to deliver transformative change, inclusive outcome and the realisation of human rights as per A Better World priority C.5 strengthening governance and C.2 gender equality.</narrative>
  </description>
